        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Paper, newsprint, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Paper, newsprint, at regional storage
na;
UUID: 587d5759-4b0f-33a5-a29f-4430dc4928ba
This module includes the transport from the production site to a central distribution site within average Europe for the domestic and the foreign newsprint paper consumed in average Europe.; Geography: Deliveries within/to Switzerland according to official Swiss trade statistics with country-specific transport distances.
Location:  Deliveries within/to Switzerland according to official Swiss trade statistics with country-specific transport distances.
Technology: Average situation
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: Total European consumption 2000: 10'904 kt (CEPI statistics)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: Standard distances for domestic production, imports from CEPI countries and imports from outside. Estimated distribution of DIP-containing and 0%-DIP newsprint based on country-specific production information (CEPI statistics).
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_587d5759-4b0f-33a5-a29f-4430dc4928ba.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
